      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm working as an ops manager for a skincare brand and i need to write an email to a customer. their order is stuck in Memphis because of some logistics error at the sorting facility and they're pretty annoyed. they want a refund on the shipping costs since it's late. can you draft a professional and empathetic email for me?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
